1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,463
16 November 2026. Just past midnight.

2
00:00:02,513 --> 00:00:05,668
A private omni bus from Bengaluru to Salem.

3
00:00:05,718 --> 00:00:10,444
Inside, a young man sits wearing a cap and a face mask.

4
00:00:10,494 --> 00:00:17,167
The bus driver has a small suspicion. That one suspicion was the final point of a robbery that shook Madurai.

5
00:00:17,217 --> 00:00:24,394
Police say a bus driver gave away the man nine special teams had searched for over five days.

6
00:00:24,444 --> 00:00:28,227
When the police surrounded the bus, he jumped out of a window and ran.

7
00:00:28,277 --> 00:00:31,306
In this video you will learn three things.

8
00:00:31,356 --> 00:00:34,574
One. How the police identified him.

9
00:00:34,624 --> 00:00:41,297
Two. What his father and Instagram influencer Meenakshi did, according to the police.

10
00:00:41,347 --> 00:00:44,565
Three. The reason the police commissioner gave for why it was done.

11
00:00:44,615 --> 00:00:47,518
This is Part 2 of the Madurai Tanishq robbery case.

12
00:00:47,568 --> 00:00:48,650
Watch till the end.

13
00:01:02,150 --> 00:01:05,292
This case is still under police investigation. There is no verdict yet.

14
00:01:05,342 --> 00:01:08,646
So everyone in this video is only an accused.

15
00:01:08,696 --> 00:01:11,568
I am telling only what the police said and what the news reported.

16
00:01:11,618 --> 00:01:14,435
Where the reports differ, I will say so.

17
00:01:14,485 --> 00:01:17,465
If you have not watched Part 1, the link is in the description.

18
00:01:17,515 --> 00:01:19,900
The pictures in the video are illustrations.

19
00:01:20,400 --> 00:01:23,256
Let me remind you of Part 1 in one minute.

20
00:01:23,306 --> 00:01:27,732
Early on 12 November 2026. A newly opened Tanishq jewellery showroom on the Madurai bypass road.

21
00:01:27,782 --> 00:01:35,929
Someone climbed the construction scaffolding, went across the terrace, dropped through the unfinished lift shaft and took the first-floor jewellery.

22
00:01:35,979 --> 00:01:41,800
One correction. In the first video I said over fifteen kilograms and twenty-one crore rupees.

23
00:01:41,850 --> 00:01:47,614
That was the figure from early reports. Now, according to the police, about eleven kilograms went missing.

24
00:01:47,664 --> 00:01:50,171
Ten kilograms of gold and one kilogram of diamond jewellery.

25
00:01:50,221 --> 00:01:57,031
Worth about fifteen crore rupees. So always trust the figure the police have confirmed over the one from early reports.

26
00:01:57,081 --> 00:02:00,577
Now the three accused. The main accused is Nishanth.

27
00:02:00,627 --> 00:02:05,170
News reports keep changing his age between twenty-two, twenty-three and twenty-five.

28
00:02:05,220 --> 00:02:08,658
One report calls him a travel vlogger and video editor.

29
00:02:08,708 --> 00:02:11,564
Second, his father Suresh, aged fifty-three.

30
00:02:11,614 --> 00:02:15,575
Third, Meenakshi, aged twenty-two, an Instagram influencer.

31
00:02:15,625 --> 00:02:18,250
Reports describe her as Nishanth's friend.

32
00:02:18,750 --> 00:02:21,880
Now see how the police closed in on him.

33
00:02:21,930 --> 00:02:24,448
This is a story of many small clues put together.

34
00:02:24,498 --> 00:02:30,564
Clue one. Before the robbery he came to the shop two or three times as a customer.

35
00:02:30,614 --> 00:02:35,824
One employee remembered him. Because he had asked for a lot of gold coins.

36
00:02:35,874 --> 00:02:42,796
Clue two. The cap. Even though he wore different clothes every day, the police say it was the same cap.

37
00:02:42,846 --> 00:02:46,221
Clue three. A tattoo on his arm. A bird and a deer.

38
00:02:46,271 --> 00:02:50,686
One report says the shop employees remembered that design.

39
00:02:50,736 --> 00:02:51,909
Here is something interesting.

40
00:02:51,959 --> 00:02:59,615
During the robbery, CCTV shows him wearing a full-body protective suit, gloves, shoes and a mask.

41
00:02:59,665 --> 00:03:04,997
The police believe he had checked beforehand that there was no camera at the back.

42
00:03:05,047 --> 00:03:08,728
Clue four. Vehicles. He used three vehicles.

43
00:03:08,778 --> 00:03:14,110
One was registered in his own name. The police seized a Yamaha Fascino scooter.

44
00:03:14,160 --> 00:03:17,351
Clue five. CCTV footage from the Palanganatham area.

45
00:03:17,401 --> 00:03:22,000
His house is there. Following that trail, the police closed in on his home.

46
00:03:22,500 --> 00:03:25,710
15 November. The police question Nishanth's father Suresh.

47
00:03:25,760 --> 00:03:30,057
The police say his answers contradicted each other.

48
00:03:30,107 --> 00:03:32,974
That suspicion led to his arrest.

49
00:03:33,024 --> 00:03:39,322
The police say that after the robbery Nishanth phoned his father and handed over a bag with jewellery.

50
00:03:39,372 --> 00:03:42,869
One report says Suresh kept that bag at home.

51
00:03:42,919 --> 00:03:45,728
The same day, Meenakshi was also arrested. What was her role?

52
00:03:45,778 --> 00:03:47,616
The reports differ a little.

53
00:03:47,666 --> 00:03:57,911
One report says the police allege she lent her two-wheeler for the robbery and knew where the jewellery was hidden.

54
00:03:57,961 --> 00:04:05,804
Another report says she had no jewellery but helped identify where it was hidden near Madakulam.

55
00:04:05,854 --> 00:04:12,725
Based on what these two told them, the police recovered about five kilograms of jewellery buried in the Madakulam area.

56
00:04:12,775 --> 00:04:18,502
One report says they both confessed and gave money trouble as the reason.

57
00:04:18,552 --> 00:04:23,649
This is the police version. What they will say in court is not yet known.

58
00:04:24,149 --> 00:04:27,423
Now look at the situation. Father arrested. Friend arrested.

59
00:04:27,473 --> 00:04:31,094
Five kilograms of jewellery in police hands. But where is the main man?

60
00:04:31,144 --> 00:04:36,426
Reports say he left Madurai and went as far as Bengaluru.

61
00:04:36,476 --> 00:04:39,888
The police have nine special teams. CCTV footage.

62
00:04:39,938 --> 00:04:43,004
Five days of searching. Now a question for you.

63
00:04:43,054 --> 00:04:47,644
With so much technology, what finally brought the police close to him?

64
00:04:47,694 --> 00:04:50,414
A camera, a signal, or something else?

65
00:04:50,464 --> 00:04:53,599
Tell me your guess in the comments, then watch on.

66
00:04:54,100 --> 00:04:56,704
The answer is very simple. A man's eyes.

67
00:04:56,754 --> 00:05:01,896
The bus driver's name is Madheshwaran. One passenger was fully covered in a cap and a mask.

68
00:05:01,946 --> 00:05:06,224
His behaviour did not feel right to the driver. He informed the police at once.

69
00:05:06,274 --> 00:05:11,301
Some reports say it was the bus conductor. Whoever it was, that tip was the turning point.

70
00:05:11,351 --> 00:05:15,628
The Adhiyamankottai police team followed the bus for about five kilometres.

71
00:05:15,678 --> 00:05:22,091
Just after midnight, on the Sesampatti bypass road in Dharmapuri district, near a bakery, they stopped the bus.

72
00:05:22,141 --> 00:05:26,302
Seeing the police surround the bus, Nishanth jumped out of a window and ran.

73
00:05:26,352 --> 00:05:34,380
But Sub-Inspector Vignesh and Head Constable Murugan caught him around one thirty after a short chase.

74
00:05:34,430 --> 00:05:39,919
Dharmapuri Superintendent of Police Arun Kabilan informed Madurai Police Commissioner Rajendiran.

75
00:05:39,969 --> 00:05:43,266
A special team from Madurai was already waiting near Salem.

76
00:05:43,316 --> 00:05:45,977
They brought Nishanth to Madurai.

77
00:05:46,027 --> 00:05:50,189
He was questioned for about four hours at Adhiyamankottai police station.

78
00:05:50,239 --> 00:05:55,901
Based on what Nishanth told them, the police recovered about six kilograms of jewellery hidden in Madurai.

79
00:05:55,951 --> 00:05:59,767
Reports differ on the place. One report says Vilacheri.

80
00:05:59,817 --> 00:06:03,748
Another says the foot of the Kapaleeswari Amman temple hill in Madakulam.

81
00:06:03,798 --> 00:06:07,441
Reports say over eleven kilograms in total has been recovered.

82
00:06:07,491 --> 00:06:10,153
Some reports say everything has been recovered.

83
00:06:10,203 --> 00:06:13,557
But another report says the police have not confirmed that.

84
00:06:13,607 --> 00:06:18,750
The Superintendent of Police praised the driver, the sub-inspector and the head constable.

85
00:06:19,250 --> 00:06:23,405
Where does the case stand now? Nishanth was produced before the court.

86
00:06:23,455 --> 00:06:25,988
He is in judicial custody until the first of December.

87
00:06:26,038 --> 00:06:28,572
He is lodged in Madurai Central Prison.

88
00:06:28,622 --> 00:06:31,936
Meenakshi and Suresh are also in judicial custody.

89
00:06:31,986 --> 00:06:37,163
The police commissioner said they want to take all three into police custody and question them further.

90
00:06:37,213 --> 00:06:40,107
Now to the question of why they did it.

91
00:06:40,157 --> 00:06:44,613
Commissioner Rajendiran said the aim was a lavish lifestyle and paying off debts.

92
00:06:44,663 --> 00:06:47,196
That is what the police side says.

93
00:06:47,246 --> 00:06:53,985
Here is a strange detail. When Meenakshi was arrested, her Instagram followers were about one and a half lakh.

94
00:06:54,035 --> 00:06:57,890
One report says it has now crossed two lakh.

95
00:06:57,940 --> 00:07:02,275
That same report says this proves nothing about the allegations.

96
00:07:02,325 --> 00:07:05,399
But it does show how fame works.

97
00:07:05,899 --> 00:07:09,140
Many questions in this case still have no answers.

98
00:07:09,190 --> 00:07:14,044
One. What was the father's role? Reports do not say what his contradictory answers were.

99
00:07:14,094 --> 00:07:19,076
Two. Under which sections will charges be filed against each person?

100
00:07:19,126 --> 00:07:20,818
We do not know that yet. Three.

101
00:07:20,868 --> 00:07:27,593
How did the first figure of twenty-one crore and fifteen kilograms become fifteen crore and eleven kilograms?

102
00:07:27,643 --> 00:07:30,239
There is no clear explanation in the reports.

103
00:07:30,289 --> 00:07:34,045
Four. Is anyone else involved besides these three?

104
00:07:34,095 --> 00:07:37,852
Reports have not said so so far. This is only the early stage of the investigation.

105
00:07:37,902 --> 00:07:43,723
Until the court gives a verdict, these three are only accused.

106
00:07:43,773 --> 00:07:46,949
If something new comes out, I will tell you in the next part.

107
00:07:47,449 --> 00:07:50,121
Let us note a few things from this case.

108
00:07:50,171 --> 00:07:56,175
One. Despite so many cameras and so much technology, it was a bus driver's suspicion that finally caught him.

109
00:07:56,225 --> 00:07:59,730
It shows how important it is to tell the police what you notice.

110
00:07:59,780 --> 00:08:03,284
Two. However well you plan, some trace is always left.

111
00:08:03,334 --> 00:08:05,506
Here it was a tattoo and the same cap.

112
00:08:05,556 --> 00:08:09,394
Three. Numbers can change. Early reports said fifteen kilograms.

113
00:08:09,444 --> 00:08:15,004
The police confirmed eleven kilograms. So it is better to wait for confirmed information.

114
00:08:15,054 --> 00:08:21,558
Now a question for you. What praise or reward do you think bus driver Madheshwaran deserves?

115
00:08:21,608 --> 00:08:24,946
Write in the comments. If you liked this video, like it.

116
00:08:24,996 --> 00:08:28,056
If you have not watched Part 1, the link is in the description.

117
00:08:28,106 --> 00:08:32,166
Subscribe to the channel. I will meet you in the next case with another mystery.

118
00:08:32,216 --> 00:08:32,500
Thank you.

